{"title":"Mossback","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 48 Mossback that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (6.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mossback\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mossback?lv=49\">Lv 49 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>5</td><td>in the wilds around 2288, 1456</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mossback?lv=49\" title=\"Pick level 49\"><td><b>49</b></td><td>290</td><td>31.5</td><td>2,450</td><td class=\"muted\">870 · 44.1 · 7,350</td><td>6</td><td>in the wilds around 2212, 1475</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shell-stone\" title=\"Shell Stone - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c64481875084d7ec0d03.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shell Stone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-199.7px,-1057.5px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/0/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:1024px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:1024px\"><i style=\"left:128.0px;top:1113.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:216.6px;top:1063.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:172.8px;top:1044.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:114.4px;top:1033.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:244.1px;top:1051.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:131.4px;top:1025.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:196.5px;top:1080.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:163.8px;top:1115.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:113.1px;top:1075.8px\"></i></div><figcaption>Sunken Avenue</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2235, 1467 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1249, 1415 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1284, 1447 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1278, 1391 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mossback\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mossback: <a href=\"#/monster/mossback-ancient\">Mossback Ancient</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/45163107ab22a39c798d.webp\" alt=\"Mossback\"></div><h3>Mossback</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>48 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 48–49)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Mossback</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>278</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>30.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2400</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.8</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>16 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}